		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">15</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us convert the algorithm step by step.
There are various things to be implemented.
a. Creating new variables (step 1)
b. Getting a character from a string, based on the index (step 2)
c. Check if one string is same as another string (step 3)
d. Repeating a set of steps (steps 5, 7)
e. Updating variables (steps 3, 4.1, 4.2)
f. Conditional blocks (steps 3, 4.2)

We have discussed a, c, d, e and f in previous assignments multiple times.</attribute>
