		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">65</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.
---
1. Normal test cases
1.1. There is exactly one valley, somewhere in the middle
1.2. There are multiple valleys, with mountains in between them
---
2. Boundary test cases
2.1. There are no valleys
2.2. There is a valley at the beginning
2.3. There is a valley at the end
2.4. There are 2 valleys, side-by-side

Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 6 new test cases.

Write them on a paper.</attribute>
