			</section>
			<section name="LabelGraphics">
				<attribute key="text" type="String">Following is an algorithm for counting the number of valleys.
1. Create 2 variables, altitude and valleyCount and initialize them to 0
2. Take a step from the trek
3. If it is U, increment the altitude
4. Otherwise,
4.1 Decrement the altitude
4.2 If altitude is -1, that means we entered a valley. Increment the valleyCount
5. Repeat steps 2 to 4, until we reach the end of the trek
6. The value of valleyCount will be the number of valleys in the given trek
7. Repeat steps 1 to 6, for each of the test cases</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontSize" type="int">12</attribute>
				<attribute key="fontName" type="String">Dialog</attribute>
				<attribute key="configuration" type="String">CroppingLabel</attribute>
				<attribute key="contentWidth" type="double">319.47475971991173</attribute>
				<attribute key="contentHeight" type="double">217.3125</attribute>
				<attribute key="autoSizePolicy" type="String">node_width</attribute>
				<attribute key="anchor" type="String">c</attribute>
			</section>
		</section>
